export default function Page2(){return <><Frame2 /><main><section className={"custom-ph custom-ph--plain relative isolate overflow-clip"} aria-labelledby={"ch-art-ph"}><div className={"glow -top-56 -left-96 [--glow-size:30rem] max-sm:-left-48 max-sm:[--glow-size:16rem]"} style={{"--glow-opacity": ".3"}} aria-hidden={"true"}></div><div className={"glow -top-56 -right-96 [--glow-size:30rem] max-sm:hidden"} style={{"--glow-opacity": ".3"}} aria-hidden={"true"}></div><div className={"container text-center"}><p className={"eyebrow m-0"} data-anim={"fade-up"}>{"The House · 9 min read"}</p><h1 id={"ch-art-ph"} className={"custom-ph-title mx-auto mt-5 mb-0"} data-anim={"fade-up"} data-anim-delay={"100"}>{"Ten floors, one concrete frame: "}<em>{"how the house was built."}</em></h1><p className={"custom-lead mx-auto mt-6 mb-0 text-balance"} data-anim={"fade-up"} data-anim-delay={"180"}>{"A 1960s office block, three years and a lot of oak. What we kept, what we cut away and why every room got a window to the floor."}</p></div></section><article className={"pb-(--section-space)"} aria-labelledby={"ch-art-ph"}><div className={"container"}><figure className={"m-0"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><img className={"custom-photo aspect-[21/9] max-md:aspect-[4/3]"} src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/2560x1440.svg"} alt={"The finished house at blue hour: ten floors of pale concrete fins and lit windows above a glass ground floor"} width={"2560"} height={"1440"} fetchPriority={"high"} decoding={"async"} /></figure><div className={"custom-byline mx-auto mt-10 flex max-w-[44rem] flex-wrap items-center gap-4"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1200x1600.svg"} alt={""} width={"1200"} height={"1600"} className={"custom-avatar [object-position:30%_30%]"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /><p className={"m-0"}><b>{"Henrique Calado"}</b><span>{"Co-founder · ran the build"}</span></p></div><div className={"article-body custom-article mt-10 text-[1.125rem] leading-[1.75]"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><p className={"drop-cap"}>{"When we first walked through the building in 2021 it was ten floors of suspended ceilings, grey carpet and strip lights, empty since an insurance company moved out. What it also had was a frame of reinforced concrete poured in 1964, sound from the foundations to the roof, and a view down the Avenida that nobody had looked at in decades."}</p><p>{"Our rule from the start: keep the frame, take away everything that hid it, and give every room the window the old offices never had. That rule cost us a year of structural work and is the reason the house feels the way it does."}</p><h2>{"Keeping the bones"}</h2><p>{"Demolishing and starting again would have been quicker and, on paper, cheaper. But the frame held 1,900 tonnes of concrete that we did not have to pour again, and the old floor heights gave us ceilings of three metres. We stripped it back to the columns, cut new openings where the windows go to the floor, and left the board-marked concrete bare in the lobby, where you can still see the grain of the 1964 shuttering."}</p><blockquote><p>{"The best material in the building was the one that was already there. We just had to stop covering it up."}</p><cite>{"Henrique Calado"}</cite></blockquote><h2>{"Fins, oak and glass"}</h2><p>{"The facade is new: pale concrete fins, spaced to keep the low summer sun off the glass and let the winter sun in. Inside, the architects at Estúdio Vale Morais kept to four materials only: smoked oak from a mill in the north, linen woven in Guimarães, black steel and a warm grey stone for the bathrooms. The rooftop pool sits on a new steel table above the old roof slab, so its weight never touches the 1964 frame."}</p><div className={"article-wide grid grid-cols-2 gap-4"}><img className={"custom-photo aspect-[4/5]"} src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1200x900.svg"} alt={"The concrete fins and oak window frames in low golden sun"} width={"1200"} height={"900"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /><img className={"custom-photo aspect-[4/5]"} src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1400x1867.svg"} alt={"The lobby's board-marked concrete wall and black steel stair"} width={"1400"} height={"1867"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /></div><h2>{"What it took"}</h2><ul><li>{"Three years, from the first drawing to the first guest in May 2025"}</li><li>{"1,900 tonnes of the original concrete frame, kept"}</li><li>{"212 new windows, every one of them to the floor"}</li><li>{"Solar panels on the plant room and heat recovered from the pool for the showers"}</li></ul><p>{"If you stay with us, take the stairs down from the lobby once. Run your hand along the concrete wall and you will feel the boards of 1964."}</p></div><aside className={"custom-author mx-auto mt-14 grid max-w-[44rem] items-center gap-6 sm:grid-cols-[6rem_minmax(0,1fr)]"} aria-label={"About the author"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1200x1600.svg"} alt={""} width={"1200"} height={"1600"} className={"custom-avatar custom-avatar--lg [object-position:30%_30%]"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /><div><p className={"custom-desk-name m-0"}>{"Henrique Calado"}<span>{"Co-founder of Draftmango House"}</span></p><p className={"mt-3 mb-0 text-soft"}>{"Henrique trained as a structural engineer and spent ten years on bridges before he and Marta started Draftmango House. He still walks the building every Monday with the maintenance team."}</p></div></aside></div></article><section className={"custom-soft py-(--section-space)"} aria-labelledby={"ch-related-title"}><div className={"container"}><div className={"mb-12 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-8"}><div className={"custom-head"}><p className={"eyebrow m-0"} data-anim={"fade-up"}>{"Keep Reading"}</p><h2 id={"ch-related-title"} className={"custom-h2 mt-4 mb-0"} data-anim={"fade-up"} data-anim-delay={"80"}>{"More from "}<em>{"the blog."}</em></h2></div><a href={"#page=demo-city-hotel-1-blog"} className={"btn btn-outline"} data-anim={"fade-up"}>{"All Posts "}<i className={"ph ph-arrow-right"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></a></div><div className={"grid gap-x-8 gap-y-14 md:grid-cols-3"} data-anim={"fade-up"} data-anim-stagger={"90"}><article className={"custom-post group relative"}><div className={"custom-post-photo"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1200x900.svg"} alt={"Sea bream and spring onions on the iron grill over glowing oak embers"} width={"1200"} height={"900"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /></div><p className={"custom-post-cat mt-5 mb-0"}>{"Food & Drink"}</p><h3 className={"custom-post-title mt-2 mb-0"}><a href={"#page=demo-city-hotel-1-article"} className={"custom-post-link"}>{"Inside Lume's open-fire kitchen"}</a></h3><p className={"mt-3 mb-0 text-base text-muted"}>{"Rui Barata · 4 min read"}</p></article><article className={"custom-post group relative"}><div className={"custom-post-photo"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1200x900.svg"} alt={"A bartender garnishing a stirred drink in a coupe on a dark oak bar"} width={"1200"} height={"900"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /></div><p className={"custom-post-cat mt-5 mb-0"}>{"Neighbourhood"}</p><h3 className={"custom-post-title mt-2 mb-0"}><a href={"#page=demo-city-hotel-1-article"} className={"custom-post-link"}>{"The Avenida after dark: eight bars within ten minutes"}</a></h3><p className={"mt-3 mb-0 text-base text-muted"}>{"Beatriz Noronha · 6 min read"}</p></article><article className={"custom-post group relative"}><div className={"custom-post-photo"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1200x900.svg"} alt={"A small sandy cove on the coast below a promenade of white houses"} width={"1200"} height={"900"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /></div><p className={"custom-post-cat mt-5 mb-0"}>{"Day Trips"}</p><h3 className={"custom-post-title mt-2 mb-0"}><a href={"#page=demo-city-hotel-1-article"} className={"custom-post-link"}>{"The coast by train: Cascais in forty minutes"}</a></h3><p className={"mt-3 mb-0 text-base text-muted"}>{"Henrique Calado · 7 min read"}</p></article></div></div></section></main><Frame1 /><button data-back-top={""} aria-label={"Back to top"} className={"back-to-top fixed bottom-8 right-8 w-11 h-11 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer border-0 text-white bg-primary shadow-token-lg z-sticky"}><i className={"ph ph-arrow-up"}></i></button></>;}

